    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidasisimsimda Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ninyas Yesu Guroorooda Ghaydit, gabiikna Yordani ak ghoadoabiiw Guroorooda ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "goobiida dareapcheeda askwearjooji haradam nea gwasimsim meang'nyeandeenda. Ea mwaaga gil eawoojisu seaniin; ng'ata askwearjoojisu, ghwayeat jih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha meang'nyeandeenda, “Iiwoosi Orjeeda ASEETA ginung' ghoah lagheaneeni mukaate.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Geang'waar gideaba, ‘Siida moamu goobiideewa ng'eanyiida mukaate ak ghwahit.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwaat meang'nyeandeenda ak goodiing'da heeda miy ghaang' ak goohiimsa darooraka sean bea ng'eanyiida gili nuwaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Gaydagoonyi gheambalmeani seaniin ea giigheambiita nyaawa; aba gideaba sigoonan, ak gaydaadaw siida wassean eagasayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iighadoawanyaan, gayghoah haleanjeeni seaniin gaagu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Geang'waar gideaba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoang'eat gadiyeadaanyi aba Galilaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gabiigu Yesu aba uurda Guroorooda ak gawa Galilaya, ak gageawiit iitaanyi aba darooraka sean neeki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goonealshachi aba jeeda ghoorajeega nyaawa siinealshacheewa, nea ghoaghaambiit buuneesean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu geaheawa aba Nasareti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghwahidu Nasareti, heeda ghayi hisiina heeda, ak gawa jeeda ghooriida siinealshacheewa, gawuurji gideajusu bea gealaan, aba eaweeda sabaato. Ghamiinaada ak ghoasoamwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geataw gitaabooda sibaneeda siguura Isaya. Ghoayaaw gitaabu ak ghwanyas heeda sing'oorsa gideaba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida beardooschi meangeenda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwararang'aada gawa Gapernaumu, was mujiineeda Galilaya. Ak ghoanaal saawa eaweeda Sabaato; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghahamng'eanyi buuneeda aba giinealshoadaanyi, aba gideaba ng'asheandaanyi gwandeawa gheambalmeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba jeedeaba ghooriidida siinealshacheewean gwanda Siisi mideawa guroorooda meangeenda muy hean; goojuur muuchi aba ghuuta haw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Seh! Ak gayhindaneasaan ang'iing'i Yesuheeda Nasareti? Ghwasaan anda giineayaneasa? Ghaanali siida uwoosi guwoosi dea Ghaydit bea ASEETA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goojuursa Yesu niny nea gwayeesha, “Siinda, ak giriteawi siisi!” Ghwanung' meangeenda ghoabeada siida aba bugusta buuneeda, ak gwariteaysa siidida nea mii gwasawan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghahamng'eanyi sean ak gaba nih eesha nuut, “Nih ana ng'ashaan? Iissa Gwarukuteawa uurda ea gheambalmeeda nea gwayeesha meangeenda arita ak gwarita.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gageawiit iitaanyi aba jeedeaba ng'eanyiita seaniin ea geeng'oojiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap fuga saang'a",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghang'eat ak gwariteawa jeeda ghooriida siinealshacheewa, ak gawa gheeh Simon. Nea abeeda gheamata agweaji Simon ghamnyaan, gabearji sheagheeda ng'waan ak geemus ghoahaap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa heeda mida gheamatida ak ghamiinaada aba murdeadaanyi, ak goojuursa sheagheeda, ak ghahaabwa gheamata sheagheadaanyi; deagheata ghang'eat ghoang'aata saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda mikteawa aseeta, ghapka buuneeda sean headaanyi nea gweadu fuga miyean bea siisi bearji geeyoadaanyi, ak ghwayiin geatingaaschi iheenga fuga miyeani ak gaheaba sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwariteaysa fuga saang'a meangeenda nea goojuuri nea gwayi, “Ang'iing'i guwoosi Orjeeda ASEETA!” Goowoowsa saawa, ak ghwarat ghuusiga ea mabaloola aba gideaba eara saawa ghwanal niny Gristo gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gwarukwiida ng'asheega aba ghoorajeega siinealshacheewa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu sakteayda ghang'eat gawa heeda manda sih, ak gagaseada buuneeda ama sihita heeda geegasa eateal ea manung'usiina heeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwayeesha saawa, Gaydawa darukwiida Giijasta Miy bea sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA aba mujiinajeega suurja, aba gideaba suh gea siicheaknaneani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwarukwiida Giijasta Miy aba jeeda ghoorajeega siinealshacheewa aba ng'eanyiida Yudeya.",
          "type": "text",
